            "notes": "# Round 1\n\n# Powers\nI start off with  [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e). This power still matters despite this build being a more grenade focused one instead of sleep, and what keeps your survivability high through the whole game.\n\n# Items\nAny common power can work, but [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) is a good choice. the rest don't matter.",
