            "notes": "# Round 2\n\n# Powers\nNext, I get [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735). The reason for this is because not only will you be spamming grenades later which means it will absolutely hit enemies at some point, but that extra damage can help finish off a kill. It scales with Ability Power too, so its a good choice. \n\n# Items\nNo matter if I lost or won the last round, I always end up with at least 14k cash minimum, but usually around 15k-20k depending on how long the round is. 14k will be able to get you these two powers, [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4), and [I.V. Drip](item_4993e9c9-738f-4aba-bfbf-c6247ff71af1). These two items can help for when your getting flanked, or just need that extra overhealth to survive a fight. Not only that, but [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) now gives a 10% CD reduction which will greatly help.\nSelling all your items just to get these two are fine. If you have extra, buy any AP item. [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is pretty good.",
