            "notes": "# Round 3\n\n# Powers\nThis is where the massive overhealth spike will come in, with [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7). Not only does this stack with [I.V. Drip](item_4993e9c9-738f-4aba-bfbf-c6247ff71af1), but you now give some good overhealth to your teammates.\n\n# Items\nI also finally get [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) here. As I said in the build notes, it works best when your team is close together/brawl team because you get it back almost instantly if you hit at least 4 teammates (including yourself). It can still work for more spread out teams, throwing it to anyone that is in a 1v1 or just to the tank to let them survive more. The ability lifesteal can also keep you alive as well in a 1v1.",
