            "notes": "# Round 4\n\n# Powers\nNo powers this round.\n\n# Items\nYou have a few options depending on what you want to do. If you find yourself still struggling with surviving, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). This gives some more CD reduction, and heals you at the same time. If you seem to be missing your grenades a lot, [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78). It can help a lot with either hitting more of your team, the enemy team, or hitting some far shots you're not sure will hit. Other than that, you can pick [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) as it quite literally gives the 20% AP from [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78) and the 10% CD reduction from [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). Plus, an extra 100 overhealth.",
