            "notes": "# Round 5\n\n# Powers\nI personally like to pick [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) as it can turn some fights around. The other two nano powers can also work, but I personally haven't tried them yet. ([My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521) & [Your Full Potential](item_f03b3a26-0d1b-46bc-85e6-92f060b53b4e))\n\n# Items\nI put the three items I mentioned in the last round all together because this is the final build IF you reached 57k by round 5. It is a little hard to cash farm with her, so here's a list of items you can use in replacement for anything you cant buy,\n\nEpics -\n[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)\n[Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939)\n[Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) (havent tried yet, but sounds good to use.)\n\nRares -\n[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n[Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) (for Ashe, another Ana, etc.)\n[Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)",
